      {
        "title": "In a Time Lapse",
        "subtitle": "Ludovico Einaudi (2013)",
        "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1520523839898-50712825e617?w=400&auto=format&fit=crop&q=80",
        "thought": "Minimalist piano interwoven with soaring string arrangements. 'Experience' is my ultimate focus anthem when debugging complex finite element routines.",
